<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Arial:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
            line-height: 1.2;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }

        .document {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #000;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        p {
            margin: 12px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .placeholder {
            border: 2px dashed #000;
            background: #f9f9f9;
            margin: 15px 0;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #555;
        }

        .placeholder::before {
            content: attr(data-caption);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="document">
        <!-- Header section -->
        <h1>CONFIDENTIAL</h1>
        <p><strong>INTERNAL MEMORANDUM</strong></p>

        <p><strong>To:</strong> All Department Heads</p>
        <p><strong>From:</strong> Executive Committee</p>
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> January 15, 2025</p>
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Q1 Budget Review &amp; Strategy Update</p>

        <p>The Executive Committee has reviewed the first-quarter financial performance and approved the following directives:</p>

        <ol>
            <li>Reallocate 15% of operating budget to digital transformation initiatives.</li>
            <li>Implement new performance metrics for all teams by March 31.</li>
            <li>Schedule a town hall meeting on February 10 at 10:00 AM.</li>
        </ol>

        <p><strong>Action Items:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>IT Department: Prepare infrastructure upgrade plan (due Feb 1).</li>
            <li>Marketing: Develop Q1 campaign timeline.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="placeholder" data-caption="[Chart: 2025 Q1 Revenue Breakdown]" style="width: 600px; height: 250px; margin: 20px auto;">
            [Bar Chart: Revenue by Division - Sales 42%, IT 28%, Marketing 15%, Admin 15%]
        </div>

        <p>For questions or clarifications, please contact the Executive Assistant at ext. 101.</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">
            End of Memorandum
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
